lution, and any correct answer is acceptable. For example, if  \"bcbc\", we can either remove 'b' at index  or 'c' at index .  Input Format  The first line contains an integer, , denoting the number of test cases.  Each line  of the  subsequent lines (where ) describes a test case in the form of a single string, .  Constraints  All characters are lowercase English letters. Output Format  Print an integer denoting the zero-indexed position of the character that makes  not a palindrome; if  is already a palindrome or no such character exists, print .  Sample Input  3 aaab baa aaa Sample Output  3 0 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":212842,"global_rank":260604},{"name":"bhuvankaruturi/python-cmd-snake-game","owner":"bhuvankaruturi","html_url":"https://github.com/bhuvankaruturi/python-cmd-snake-game","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Command prompt window snake game using python (curses)","topics":[],"score":212841,"global_rank":260605},{"name":"MarcCharbo/pig","owner":"MarcCharbo","html_url":"https://github.com/MarcCharbo/pig","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":4,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":212841,"global_rank":260610},{"name":"baka656/Tweet-Analyzer","owner":"baka656","html_url":"https://github.com/baka656/Tweet-Analyzer","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Leveraging sentiment analysis, topic modeling, and summarization, the Twitter Data Analysis Tool project achieved a deep grasp of sentiments and themes. An intuitive Tkinte